Here's a product landing page with a hero, a three-column feature grid, a testimonial, and a call-to-action button.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "product-landing",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-marketing-commerce.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9.1",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "product-landing",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 1,
          "gap": "3rem",
          "align": "stretch",
          "items": [
            { "blocks": ["hero", "features", "testimonial", "cta"] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hero",
          "component": "gradient_hero",
          "badge": "New · Version 2.0",
          "title": "Ship your projects faster with Flowdesk",
          "subtitle": "One workspace for planning, collaboration, and delivery, so your team spends less time coordinating and more time building.",
          "align": "center",
          "accent": "#4f46e5",
          "accent2": "#8b5cf6"
        },
        {
          "id": "features",
          "component": "feature_grid",
          "heading": "Everything your team needs",
          "description": "Powerful tools that stay out of your way.",
          "columns": 3,
          "features": [
            {
              "icon": "⚡",
              "title": "Lightning-fast workflows",
              "description": "Automate repetitive tasks and move work forward with a single click.",
              "color": "#4f46e5"
            },
            {
              "icon": "🤝",
              "title": "Real-time collaboration",
              "description": "Comment, assign, and edit together, with everyone always on the same page.",
              "color": "#8b5cf6"
            },
            {
              "icon": "📊",
              "title": "Insightful analytics",
              "description": "Track progress and spot bottlenecks with dashboards that update live.",
              "color": "#0ea5e9"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "testimonial",
          "component": "testimonial_card",
          "text": "Flowdesk cut our planning meetings in half. Our team ships features twice as fast, and everyone actually knows what's going on.",
          "author_name": "Priya Sharma",
          "author_title": "VP of Engineering, Northwind Labs",
          "author_avatar_url": "https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47",
          "rating": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "cta",
          "component": "cta_button",
          "label": "Start your free trial",
          "url": "https://example.com/signup",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "same_tab": true
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

**How the page is laid out:**
- **Root:** The root is a single-column `columns` container. It stacks the four sections from top to bottom by referencing them by ID.
  - I set `cols` to 1 to get a single full-width stack. The catalog describes a range of 2–6 columns, so a renderer could treat 1 differently than intended.
- **Hero:** A centered `gradient_hero` shows the headline and subhead.
- **Features:** A `feature_grid` with `columns: 3` shows three features, each with an icon, title, and description.
- **Testimonial:** A `testimonial_card` shows the quote, author, title, avatar, and a 5-star rating.
- **Call to action:** A `cta_button` links to the sign-up page and opens in the same tab.
